  "instruction": "Please list all the people who were added to the FBI's Most Wanted list in 2000 or 2001 who were convicted of murder within the ten years after their placement on the list.",
  "answer": "Based on my research of all 10 fugitives added to the FBI Ten Most Wanted list in 2000-2001, **five individuals** were convicted of murder within 10 years of their placement:\n\n## Qualified Individuals (5)\n\n| Name | FBI # | Date Added | Conviction Date | Within 10 Years |\n|------|-------|------------|-----------------|-----------------|\n| **Jesse James Caston** | 459 | Aug 19, 2000 | Aug 16, 2004 | ✓ (3.9 years) |\n| **Aurlieas Dame McClarty** | 461 | Feb 24, 2001 | May 7, 2008 | ✓ (7.2 years) |\n| **Francis William Murphy** | 464 | Jun 6, 2001 | Aug 4, 2003 | ✓ (2.2 years) |\n| **Dwight Bowen** | 465 | Aug 30, 2001 | Feb 19, 2004 | ✓ (2.5 years) |\n| **Felix Summers** | 468 | Oct 30, 2001 | Nov 13, 2006 | ✓ (5.0 years) |\n\n## Excluded Individuals (5)\n\n| Name | FBI # | Date Added | Reason |\n|------|-------|------------|--------|\n| Eric Franklin Rosser | 460 | Dec 27, 2000 | Convicted of child pornography, not murder |\n| Hopeton Eric Brown | 462 | Mar 17, 2001 | Killed in 2004 shootout, never tried |\n| Maghfoor Mansoor | 463 | May 23, 2001 | Killed 12 days *before* listing, never tried |\n| Nikolay Soltys | 466 | Aug 23, 2001 | Suicide in jail 2002 before trial |\n| Clayton Lee Waagner | 467 | Sep 21, 2001 | Convicted of anthrax hoaxes, bank robbery, firearms — never charged with murder |\n\n## Sources\n- FBI Ten Most Wanted 401-500 archive: https://www.fbi.gov/wanted/topten/ten-most-wanted-fugitives-faq/ten-most-wanted-401-500\n- Caston: https://caselaw.findlaw.com/court/la-court-of-appeal/1355986.html\n- McClarty: https://www.orlandosentinel.com/2008/05/14/jury-chooses-life-not-death-for-killer-of-2\n- Murphy: https://law.justia.com/cases/new-york/appellate-division-fourth-department/2006/2006-03204.html\n- Bowen: https://law.justia.com/cases/pennsylvania/superior-court/2022/2177-eda-2021.html\n- Summers: https://www.inquirer.com/news/juvenile-lifer-resentencing-felix-summers-south-philadelphia-shooting-witness-murder-20190627.html\n- Rosser: https://www.fbi.gov/news/pressrel/press-releases/fbi-top-ten-most-wanted-fugitive-eric-franklin-rosser-captured\n- Brown: https://www.jamaicaobserver.com/2004/03/22/cops-cut-down-gunman-on-fbi-most-wanted-list\n- Mansoor: https://www.nytimes.com/2001/05/12/nyregion/fugitive-shot-and-killed-by-the-authorities-in-a-bustling-midtown-hotel-lobby.html\n- Soltys: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nikolay_Soltys\n- Waagner: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clayton_Waagner",
